# Hugo regenerates assets/jsconfig.json on every build, and its contents track the
# Hugo version (0.163.0 dropped the deprecated `baseUrl` key, 0.165.0 changed the
# source root mapping). Committing it meant every build flipped the file, so the
# nightly reference-docs PRs carried a phantom diff alongside the real reference
# changes. It is a VS Code IntelliSense aid only; nothing reads it at build time.
